an></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong></strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></font><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span>&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></font></p><div style=\"HEIGHT: 15px; WIDTH: 99%; BACKGROUND: url(http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/webeditor/images/deco/line06.gif?rv=1.0.1) repeat-x left 50%\"><hr style=\"BORDER-LEFT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: black; BORDER-BOTTOM-WIDTH: 0px; POSITION: relative; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: black; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: black; LEFT: -999px; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: black; TOP: -999px; BORDER-TOP-WIDTH: 0px\"></div><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#0900ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong></strong></span></span></span></span></span></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2018학년도 2학기 학기 중 부서별 근로장학생을 모집하오니 희망하는 학생은 기간 내에 신청하시기 바랍니다.</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">- 근로장학생 선발은 선착순이 아님을 알려드립니다.</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">- 신청자 전체 명단이 신청기간 후에 각 부서에 일괄적으로 통보됩니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp; </span><br></font><font color=\"#000000\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffd9ec\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Ⅰ. 국가 교육근로장학생</span></strong></span><br></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. 자격요건&nbsp;</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 2018-2학기 재학생 중 한국장학재단 국가 교육근로장학사업&nbsp;신청자 중 순위 통과자</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;※ 순위확인 방법 :&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">한국장학재단에서 확인</span></span></font> </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;(신청기간 중에는 원스톱서비스 로그인→학생지원→근로장학생 신청서 제출에서도 확인 가능)<font color=\"#000000\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 정규학기 내 재학생 (휴학생, 초과학기자 제외)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;다. 소득 정보 확인 : 8분위 이하</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;라. 직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(평점 1.6) 이상</span></font></span></span></font></span></span></font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 신청기간 : 2018.8.16.(목) 10:00 ~ 8.20.(월) 18:00 까지</span></span></span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가.&nbsp;주말 포함 신청 가능</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 전화 문의는 평일 근무시간 내 가능</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">3. 근로기간 : 2018.9.1.(토)~12.23.(일) [학기 중]</span></font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 부서 신청방법</span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 원스톱서비스 로그인&nbsp;- 학생지원 - 근로장학생 신청서 제출 - </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신청 상세내역작성( 계좌등록, 근무부서, 희망 부서 및 희망근무시간 입력) - </span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 신청버튼 클릭 - 완료</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 국가근로 우선선발순위: <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #e4f7ba\">“1순위(소득 4분위 이하)&gt; 2순위(5~6분위)&gt; 3순위(7~8분위)”</font></span><br></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1) 1순위 : 국가근로 신청가능</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 2순위, 3순위 : 국가근로 신청가능하나, 1순위자가 근로배정인원보다 적은 경우 등 부득이한 경우 </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2순위→3순위 순으로 근로선발 가능</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 순위 외 : 국가근로 선발순위 없음, 국가근로 신청불가<font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#000000\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;다. 근무부서, 희망근무장소 : 붙임 참고 (반드시 파일확인 후 신청하세요)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;라. 희망근무시간(가능한 시간 모두 기재)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 시간 입력시 시간단위는 24시간으로 기재(오후 3시일 경우 → 15시로 입력)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ex) 월:13:00~15:00/ 화:11:00~12:00, 15:00~17:00/ 수:14:00~18:00/ 목: 없음/ 금: 9:00~13:00</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 반드시 수업시간을 제외한 근로가능시간을 입력해야 함</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;마. 모두 입력 후 신청버튼 클릭~! 별도 제출서류 없음</span></font></span></font></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 선발일정</span></span></span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 학생 : 희망근무부서 신청[2018.8.16.(목) 10:00 ~ 8.20.(월) 18:00 까지]<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 각 해당부서 : 각 부서에서 희망근무부서 신청자 명단을 확인하여 해당 학생에게 연락 확인 후 추천</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;다. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">학생처 : 근로장학생 선발확정(예정)&nbsp;[2018.8.28.(화)]</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. 근로장학금액 : 근로 다음달 10일 지급(10일이 주말일 경우 금요일에 지급)</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 교내일반 : 시간당 급여 8.000원</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 교외일반 : 시간당 급여 10,500원</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><div style=\"HEIGHT: 15px; WIDTH: 99%; BACKGROUND: url(http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/webeditor/images/deco/line05.gif?rv=1.0.1) repeat-x left 50%\"><hr style=\"BORDER-LEFT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT-WIDTH: 0px; BORDER-TOP-COLOR: black; BORDER-BOTTOM-WIDTH: 0px; POSITION: relative; BORDER-LEFT-COLOR: black; BORDER-BOTTOM-COLOR: black; LEFT: -999px; BORDER-RIGHT-COLOR: black; TOP: -999px; BORDER-TOP-WIDTH: 0px\"></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffd9ec\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">Ⅱ. 대학근로장학생 </span></strong></span></span><br></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. 자격요건</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 2018-2학기 재학생 중 직전학기 성적 70점/100점 만점(평점 1.6) 이상</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 정규학기 내 재학생 (휴학생, 초과학기자 제외)</span></span></font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2. 신청기간 : 2018.8.16.(목) 10:00 ~ 8.20.(월) 18:00 까지</font></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"