 제출</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 신청 상세내역작성(계좌등록, 근무부서, 희망 부서 및 희망근무시간 입력) </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 신청버튼 클릭 - 완료</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. 선발일정</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 학생 : 희망근무부서 신청[2018.9.1.(토)~12.23.(일) [학기 중]</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 각 해당부서 : 각 부서에서 희망근무부서 신청자 명단 확인하여 해당 학생에게 연락 확인 후 추천</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;다. 학생처 : 근로장학생 선발확정(예정)&nbsp;[2018.8.28.(화)]</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">7. 근로장학금액 : 근로 다음달 10일 지급(10일이 주말일 경우 금요일에 지급)</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;가. 일반근로 : 시간당 급여 7,530원</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;나. 육체근로(식당) : 시간당 급여 8,000원&nbsp; </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffd9ec\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong>Ⅲ. 유의사항</strong></span></font></span></span><br></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">1. 학적변동자(휴학, 제적, 졸업 등) 신청 불가[근로장학금 지급 불가]</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">2. 근로시간은 근무부서에 따라 다름</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">3. 수업시간과 근로시간 중복불가 </span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">붙임 2018-2학기 학기중 부서별 근로시간 배정표 1부.</font></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">2018.&nbsp;&nbsp; 8.</font></span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            </span></span>"}
